          "effectiveAfter": "T’AU EMPIRE model only (excluding KROOT SHAPER models). While the bearer is leading a unit, each time that unit is an Observer unit, until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in a Guided unit have the [LETHAL HITS] ability while targeting their Spotted unit.",
          "glossaryTermId": "tau-empire-enhancement-through-unity-devastation",
          "unavailableReason": null
        }
      ]
    },
